<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-COLONIAL CLASSIC RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-COLONIAL CLASSIC RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the Colonial Classic exibition tennis event at Kooyong on Wednesday.</p>
<p>First round  </p>
<p>Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat Michael Stich (Germany) 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>Boris Becker (Germany) beat Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) 7-6 (7-3) 6-1</p>
<p>Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Jim Courier (U.S.) 7-6 (10-8) 6-4</p>
</text>
